  "source": "https://gc.nh.gov/rsa/html/LXIII/669/669-38.htm",
  "statuteText": "669:38 Party Regulations. –\n\nAny party qualified to hold a caucus may, in convention or by its recognized political committee, make regulations concerning the manner of holding the caucus consistent with the provisions of this subdivision."
